## 8. Build Plan — Slices & Widget↔Namespace Map

**BUILT today:** `composeio.self_sensor` (`self/*` sensor, 15/15, [CXC-IC-SELF]); the composeio-native channel + launcher-actuator (`intelligence/<id>/{in,out,permission/*}`, dev-flag bringup verified on the glass, [CXC-IC-CHANNEL]/[CXC-IC-LIFECYCLE]); the harness monitor (`intelligence/launcher/monitor.py` — query + heartbeat glass-green, thresholds machine-green pending live-fire, [CXC-IC-MONITOR]); the transcript publisher (`intelligence/publisher/transcript_publisher.py` — `thread/narration`/`self/activity`/`self/subagents`, [CXC-IC-STREAMS]); Slice 1 — Skia scene rendering (`intelligence/console/console.compose.yaml`, backend-agnostic scene per the decisions ledger).

**Remaining slices:**

| slice | scope | bus namespaces | status |
|---|---|---|---|
| 2 | chat-thread widget | `thread/narration`, `intelligence/<id>/out`, `intelligence/<id>/in` (harness events) | not built |
| 2.5 | AUQ question widget ([CXC-IC-QUESTION]) | `.../question/request`, `.../question/verdict` | not built |
| 3 | instrument rail live | `self/context_level` (needs a continuous publisher), `self/registered` checklist (NEW widget), `self/*` LEDGER | not built |
| 4 | avatar (NEW) + activity/subagents sub-widgets | `self/avatar/expression` (two-publisher, arbitrated), `self/activity`, `self/subagents` | not built |
| 5 | git graph + mermaid canvas | `thread/diagram`, git-sensor namespaces | not built — mermaid-on-Skia is the one infra risk (degrade-to-source, or a headless mermaid→SVG→SvgWidget pipeline) |

**Widget ↔ namespace binding map:**

| widget | bound namespace(s) | source node |
|---|---|---|
| chat-thread | `thread/narration`, `intelligence/<id>/out`, `intelligence/<id>/in` | [CXC-IC-STREAMS], [CXC-IC-CHANNEL] |
| question cards (AUQ) | `.../question/request`, `.../question/verdict` | [CXC-IC-QUESTION] |
| context gauge | `self/context_level` | [CXC-IC-SELF], [CXC-IC-MONITOR] |
| registered checklist | `self/registered` | [CXC-IC-SELF] |
